WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:12.820
Nowadays parents are increasingly aware that allowing kids more freedom to explore and learn on their own helps foster their independence and boost their confidence.
如今，父母越来越意识到，给孩子更多自主探索和学习的自由，有助于培养他们的独立性、增强他们的自信心。

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:23.550
In the past, many parents tended to arrange everything for their children, from what to study to how to spend their weekends, leaving them little room to make their own choices.
过去，许多父母往往把孩子的一切都安排好，从学什么到周末怎么过，几乎不给孩子留下自己做选择的余地。

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:26.940
Giving children freedom brings clear benefits.
给孩子自由会带来显而易见的好处。

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:35.270
When kids are allowed to solve problems by themselves, they learn to think independently and take responsibility for their decisions.
当孩子被允许自己解决问题时，他们就能学会独立思考，并为自己的决定承担责任。

00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:41.110
Even their mistakes become valuable lessons, teaching them what works and what does not.
就连他们犯的错误也会变成宝贵的教训，让他们明白什么行得通、什么行不通。

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:50.850
In addition, every small success they achieve on their own, such as building a model or cooking a simple meal, makes them believe in their abilities.
此外，他们靠自己取得的每一次小小的成功，比如搭好一个模型或做一顿简单的饭菜，都会让他们相信自己的能力。

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:58.040
I still remember how proud I felt when my parents first let me take the subway to school alone at the age of ten.
我至今还记得，十岁那年父母第一次让我独自坐地铁上学时，我是多么自豪。

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:01.660
That experience made me feel trusted and capable.
那次经历让我感到自己被信任，而且有能力做好事情。

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:05.720
Of course, freedom does not mean a lack of guidance.
当然，自由并不意味着缺少引导。

00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:14.270
Parents should set clear safety rules, offer advice when needed and be ready to step in when their children run into real difficulties.
父母应该制定明确的安全规则，在需要时给出建议，并随时准备在孩子遇到真正的困难时出手相助。

00:01:15.070 --> 00:01:21.360
Within these limits, parents can let children plan a weekend outing or manage a small weekly allowance.
在这些限度之内，父母可以让孩子自己筹划一次周末出游，或者管理一小笔每周的零花钱。

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:28.470
With a proper balance between freedom and support, children can grow into independent and confident adults.
在自由与支持之间把握好平衡，孩子就能成长为独立而自信的成年人。
